{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14104390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14104390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1410439001:0":{"text":"やめてください！ケイデンは、優しい子なんです！","source_cn":"不要伤害凯登！他是个好孩子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x486697EDCDFEF79D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410439002:0":{"text":"来るな！すでに厄化している。お前たちは安全な場所へ――","source_cn":"别过来！他已经孽化了！为了你们的安全——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F1B922528A6749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410439003:1":{"text":"お前たちのせいだ！お前たちのせいで、ベルヴェとケイデンは……！","source_cn":"都是你们的错！是你们害的！先是贝丝薇，又是凯登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0877928701B835F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410439004:1":{"text":"武器を持って何をするつもりだ！？まさか、それで二人の首をはねるのか！？","source_cn":"你拿着武器，要做什么？是不是要斩下他们的头颅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306495E9358A91A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410439005:1":{"text":"人殺し！","source_cn":"杀人犯！刽子手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2896D7D024E2B776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410439006:1":{"text":"サロクディアのために、俺たちがどれだけ尽くしてきたか……いや、すべてを捧げてきたというのに！これがその報いなのか！？","source_cn":"我们为萨洛克兰付出了很多！不……我们付出了一切！然而这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB59E3B3ACAF059CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410439007:0":{"text":"ソルンの言う通りよ！知識も資源も、全部貴族が独り占めして……私たち平民はどれだけ努力しても、少しのミスですべてを失う！","source_cn":"索伦说的没错！知识和资源被贵族们垄断，我们拼尽全力爬到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x766DD21D52342E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410439008:0":{"text":"先祖代々、同じ運命の繰り返し、絶えず厄化の恐怖にさらされる日々……それが、私たちの宿命だというの！？","source_cn":"世世代代重复着所谓的命运，时时刻刻面临着孽化产生的风险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF9604E85912A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410439009:0":{"text":"同じ平民の出身として、皆の苦しみは理解している……","source_cn":"诸位，我了解你们的痛苦。我也同样是平民出身……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x275DFEF74446402C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410439010:0":{"text":"だが今は厄化の蔓延を防ぐのが先決だ、そこをどいてくれ！","source_cn":"但现在最重要的是阻止孽化蔓延，请让开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB428C355F6BCECDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s